# Stale self-deploy output. The old deploy.sh could target this repo itself,
# leaving copies of the kit at the root. A root .claude/commands or .claude/skills
# SHADOWS the plugin's own skills when this repo is opened in a harness, so those
# must never be committed. deploy.sh is gone, so nothing regenerates them.
#
# CLAUDE.md and AGENTS.md are deliberately NOT ignored: nothing generates them now,
# and this repository should be able to carry its own project instructions.
/.claude/
/agent_docs/
/tasks/

# Machine-local Compound Engineering config
/compound-engineering.local.md

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
